  "description": {
    "en-US": "The twelve sets of *quodlibeta* (open-topic disputations) conducted by Aquinas at Paris (Advent and Lent, 1268–1272) and Naples, in which the master answered any question put by the audience. Full bilingual edition: Sandra Edwards for Quodlibets I–II (PIMS, 1983) and the Aquinas Institute team for III–XII.",
    "la": "Duodecim quodlibeta — disputationes Thomae Parisienses (Adventu et Quadragesima, 1268–1272) et Neapolitanae, in quibus magister cuilibet ex auditoribus quaerenti respondebat.",
    "pt-BR": "Os doze conjuntos de *quodlibeta* (disputas de tema livre) conduzidos por Tomás de Aquino em Paris (Advento e Quaresma, 1268–1272) e Nápoles, nos quais o mestre respondia a qualquer pergunta proposta pelos ouvintes. Edição bilíngue integral: Sandra Edwards para os Quodlibetos I–II (PIMS, 1983) e a equipe do Aquinas Institute para os III–XII."
  },
  "composed": "1268–1272",
